data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"### The Biological Training Manual: How Vaccines Teach Your Immune System\n\nImagine your immune system is a highly sophisticated","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" security force tasked with protecting a fortress—your body. This force is composed of specialized cells, chemical signals, and complex","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" protocols designed to identify and neutralize intruders like bacteria and viruses. However, a security force is only as effective as its intelligence","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":". If a new, aggressive intruder arrives that the force has never encountered before, the response may be slow, disorganized,","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" and ultimately unsuccessful, allowing the intruder to take over the fortress.\n\nThis is where vaccines come in. A vaccine is","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" essentially a training simulation. It provides your immune system with a \"wanted poster\" or a \"practice drill,\" allowing your","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" body to learn how to fight a specific pathogen without ever having to face the actual, dangerous disease.\n\n#### The Key","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" Player: The Antigen\n\nTo understand how vaccines work, you must first understand the **antigen**. An antigen is a","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

